From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jay Leaton <58495321+jayleaton@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 23:36:40 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 013/207] Merge image decoder bounds and ownership fixes

Integrate PNG palette and pass bounds, JPEG Huffman and frame ownership, GIF alphabet limits, zero-size preprocessing refusals and BMP RLE bounds. Preserve the six source commits and their authorship.

Squashed merge of 6 commits:
- deepseek: bound PNG palette transparency and pass sizes (Jay Leaton)
- deepseek: reject an oversubscribed JPEG Huffman bucket before filling it (Jay Leaton)
- deepseek: reject a second JPEG frame and release a partial one (Jay Leaton)
- deepseek: refuse an image whose fitted side rounds to zero (Jay Leaton)
- deepseek: limit the GIF LZW minimum code size to the byte alphabet (Jay Leaton)
- deepseek: bound BMP RLE to the frame and its own bit depths (Jay Leaton)
---
